==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|el}} [[κόσμος]] (''[[cosmos]]'') meaning [[world]], and [[πόλις]] (''[[polis]]'') meaning [[city]], [[people]], [[citizenry]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-cosmopolitan.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{wikipedia}}
'''cosmopolitan'''

# [[all-inclusive]]; affecting the whole [[world]]
# {{context|of a place|or institution}} composed of [[people]] from all over the world
# {{context|of a person}} at [[ease]] in any part of the world
# {{context|of a plant etc.}} [[growing]] in many parts of the world; widely distributed

